From c2e8852cba7d9ec47819b66880a5d59014328210 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 18:29:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ship): register the created PR as a kernel_pr row

forge ship is the one moment the PR->worktree->issue link is derivable with
zero user input, but nothing wrote kernel_pr, so reconcile (which only
enriches existing rows) had nothing to enrich. Register via the broker's
upsertPr, deriving issue_id/worktree_id from the current worktree's
kernel_worktrees row. Key off projectRoot, not git rev-parse --show-toplevel,
whose differing path form would hide the row from every consumer.

Refs kernel issue c3952ba5

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
